What SSH Tunnel does
Your Browser → localhost:8080
                    ↓
              SSH Tunnel (encrypted)
                    ↓
              EC2 → localhost:8080 (Keycloak)
Keycloak sees the request coming from its own machine (localhost), not from a public IP. So it thinks:

"Oh this is a local request, HTTP is fine"



