Verify the secret actually changed
Run this:
powershellaws secretsmanager get-secret-value `
  --secret-id keycloak-rotation-demo/client-secret `
  --version-stage AWSCURRENT `
  --region eu-north-1 `
  --query SecretString --output text
You should see a new value for KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET — different from what you originally put in. That's your rotated secret!


